  "thumb_text": "LOOK CLOSE!",
  "description": "Stripes or spots? Look closely with Milo the bluebird and pick your answer! Then look even closer: a zebra's skin is black under its stripes, a tiger's skin is striped too, a baby panda is born pink and as small as a stick of butter, and every cow's spots are like a fingerprint.\nAn interactive look-and-find animal lesson for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, counting, actions to copy and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Characters and visuals are animated with the help of AI tools and reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
